# TEAM.md is the one file more than one person might append to. `merge=union`
# keeps every line from both sides instead of raising a conflict nobody in a
# breakout should have to resolve.
#
# It is normally written once, by whoever created the repo: the pod's name and
# one line per person. The union rule is there for the late joiner who adds
# their own line while somebody else is adding theirs.
TEAM.md merge=union
